cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Cited Photo Archive Registry — Photo Registry 232"
version: 1.0
date-released: 2026-11-16
abstract: "The registry of CultureTechLens' 232 published Cited Photo Archive evidence cards: per photo, registry ID, title, photographer, source, rights statement, what it documents, the citation as published, page/file URLs, and an AEO question and answer. All 232 rows are rights-stated (119 public domain; the rest CC and CC0); none uncleared. Extracted verbatim from culturetechlens.com/photos/ on 2026-11-04 and governed by CTL-PHOTO-001/002. Distinct from the internal Photo Rights Log v4 — the two are never merged."
authors:
  - name: "CultureTechLens NFP"
